dektoiú ojfeivlousin eiønai ejn eJtevraé ejkklhsivaé, ajllaú paðsan
toiðû</FOREIGN> <NOTE N="*" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0045" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0045D"></COL> Legendum videtur  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>aujtoiðû.</FOREIGN>   <ED>EDIT</ED> .</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ajnavgkhn ejpavgesqai crhú, ajnastrevfein eijû taúû eJautwðn
paroikivaû× hÞ ejpimevnontaû, ajkoinwnhvtouû eiønai proshvkei.
 <COL N="0045C"></COL> Eij kaiú tolmhvseievn tiû uJfarpaðsai toún twðé eJtevrwé diafevronta,
kaiú ceirotonhðsai ejn thðé aujtouð ejkklhsivaé, mhú sugkatatiqemevnou
