hJ ejnquvmhsiû, faivnetai oåti uJpoú thðû cavritoû ejrjrjuvsqh.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0053"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>n'. Kathcouvmenoû ejaún eijsercovmenoû eijû toú kuriakoún ejn
thðé twðn kathcoumevnwn tavxei sthkhé, oußtoû deú aJmartavnwn,
ejaún meún govnu klivnwn, ajkroavsqw mhkevti aJmartavnwn. 1Eaún
deú kaiú ajkrowvmenoû eæti aJmartavnhé, ejxwqeivsqw.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0053"><COL N="0055A"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>na'. Periú kuoforouvshû, oåti deið fwtivzesqai oJpovte bouvletai.
Oujdeún gaúr ejn touvtwé koinwneið hJ tivktousa twðé tiktomevnwé
diaú toú, eJkavstou ijdivan thún proaivresin thún ejpiú thðé
oJmologivaé deivknusqai.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0055"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>nb'. Presbuvteron eijû gavmouû digamouvntwn mhú eJstiaðsqai,
ejpeiú metavnoian aijtouðntoû touð digavmou, tivû eæstai oJ
presbuvteroû, oJ diaú thðû eJstiavsewû sugkatatiqevmenoû toiðû
gamoiû_</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0055"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ng'. Gunhv tinoû moiceuqeiðsa laiçkouð oæntoû, ejaún ejlevgcqhé
fanerwðû, oJ toiouðtoû eijû uJphresivan ejlqeiðn ouj duvnatai.
1Eaún deú kaiú metaú thún ceirotonivan moiceuqhðé, ojfeivlei ajpoluðsai
aujthvn. 1Eaún deú suzhðé, ouj duvnatai eæcesqai thðû ejgceirhsqeivshû 
aujtwðé uJphresivaû [diakonivaû].</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0055"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>nd'. Presbuvteroû, ejaún prohmarthkwúû swvmati proacqhðé,
 <COL N="0055B"></COL> kaiú oJmologhvshé oåti håmarten proú thðû ceirotoniacgr_aû×
mhú prosferevtw, mevnwn ejn toiðû loipoiðû, diaú thún aællhn
spoudhvn. Taú gaúr loipaú [pollaú] aJmarthvmata eæfasan oiJ
polloiú kaiú thún ceiroqesivan ajfievnai. 1Eaún deú aujtoúû mhú
oJmologhðé, ejlegcqhðnai deú fanerwðû mhú dunhqhðé, ejp1 aujtwðé
ejkeivnw poieiðsqai thún ejxousivan.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0055"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ne'. 2Omoivwû kaiú diavkonoû eij ejn twðé aujtwðé aJmarthvmati
