presbutevrwn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0069"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rig'. Periú tou, mhú sugcwreiðn eijû taú koimhthria hÞ eijû
 <COL N="0069C"></COL> taú legovmena martuvria pavntwn twðn aiJretikwðn ajpievnai
touúû thðû ejkklhsivaû, eujchðû hÞ qerapeivaû eåneka ajllaú touúû
toiouvtouû, ejaún wøsi pistoiú, ajkoinwnhvtouû givnesqai mevcri
tinovû× metanoouðntaû deú kaiú ejxomologoumevnouû ejsfavlqai,
paradevcesqai.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0069"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rid'. Periú touð, mhú deiðn touúû thðû ejkklhsivaû ajdiafovrwû
