kaiú uJpocwrhsavntwn, o uåtwû taúû eujcaúû twðn pistwðn givnesqai
treiðû× mivan meún thún prwvthn, diaú siwphðû× thún deú
deutevran kaiú trivthn, diaú prosfwnhvsewû plhrouðsqai× eiøq1
ouåtwû thún eijrhvnhn divdosqai× kaiú metaú toú, presbutevrouû
douðnai twðé ejpiskovpwé thún eijrhvnhn, tovte touúû laiçkouúû thún
eijrhvnhn didovnai× kaiú ouåtw thún aJgivan prosforaún ejpiteleiðsqai×
kaiú movnoiû ejxoún eiønai (ejxeiðnai) toiðû iJeratikoiðû eijsievnai
eijû qusiasthvrion, kaiú koinwneiðn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0071"><COL N="0071B"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rkd'. 4Oti ouj deið diavkonon eæmprosqen presbutevrou
kaqevzesqai, ajllaú metaú keleuvsewû touð presbutevrou kaqevzesqai.
2Omoivwû deú eæcein timhún kaiú touúû diakovnouû uJpoú
twðn uJphretwðn, kaiú pavntwn twðn klhrikwðn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0071"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rkev'. 4Oti ouj deið uJphrevtaû eæcein cwvran ejn twðé diakonikwðé,
