quvraû ejgkatalimpavnein.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0071"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rkz'. 4Oti ouj deið ajnagnwvstaû hÞ yavltaû wjravrion foreiðn 
kaiú ouåtwû ajnaginwvskein hÞ yavllein.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0071"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rkh'. 4Oti ouj deið iJeratikouúû ajpoú presbutevrwn eåwû
