hÞ ajnagnwstwðn hÞ yaltwðn hÞ ejporkistwðn [ejforkistwðn]
hÞ qurwrwðn, hÞ touð tavgmatoû twðn ajskhtwðn, eijû kaphleiðon
 <COL N="0071C"></COL> eijsievnai.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0071"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rkq'. 4Oti ouj deið uJphrevtaû aærton didovnai, oujdeú pothvrion
