touð Qeouð, kaiú ajpievnai, kaiú ajggeúlouû ojnomavzein kaiú
sunavxeiû poieiðn, aåper ajphgovreutai. Eiæ tiû ouøn euJreqhðé
tauvthðé thðé kekrummevnhé eijdwlolatrivaé scolavzwn, eæstw
ajnavqema, oåti ejgkatevlipen toún kuvrion hJmwðn 1Ihsouðn Cristoún,
toún uiJoún touð Qeouð, kaiú eijdwlolatrivaé proshðlqen.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><COL N="0073B"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rm'. 4Oti ouj deið iJeratikouúû hÞ klhrikouúû, mavgouû hÞ
ejpaoidouúû eiønai, hÞ maqhmatikouúû hÞ ajstrolovgouû, hÞ poieiðn
taú legovmena fulakthvria, aå tinav ejsti desmwthvria twðn
yucwðn aujtwðn× touúû deú forouðntaû rJivptesqai ejk thðû ejkklhsivaû
ejkeleuvsamen.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rma'. 4Oti ouj deið paraú twðn 1Ioudaivwn hÞ aiJretikwðn taú
pempovmena eJortastikaú lambavnein, mhdeú suneortavzein
aujtoiðû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rmb'. 4Oti ouj deið paraú twðn 1Ioudaivwn aæzuma lambavnein,
hÞ koinwneiðn taiðû ajsebeivaiû aujtwðn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rmg'. 4Oti ouj deið toiðû ejqnesi suneortavzein, kaiú koinwneiðn
thðé ajqeovthti aujtwðn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rmd'. 4Oti ouj deið ejpiskovpouû kaloumevnouû eijû suvnodon
katafroneiðn, ajll1 ajpievnai kaiú didavskein hÞ didavskesqai,
 <COL N="0073C"></COL> eijû katovrqwsin thðû ejkklhsivaû kaiú twðn loipwðn× eij deú
katafronhvseien oJ toiouðtoû, eJautoún aijtiavsetai× parektoúû,
eij mhú di1 ajnwmalivan ajpolimpavnoito.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rme'. 4Oti ouj deið iJeratikoún hÞ klhrikoún aæneu kanonikwðn
grammavtwn oJdeuvein.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rm¾'. 4Oti ouj deið iJeratikoún hÞ klhrikoún aæneu keleuvsewû
ejpiskovpou oJdeuvein.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rmz'. 4Oti ouj deið uJphrevtaû, kaÞén proúû bracuú, taúû quvraû
ejgkataleivpein, ajllaú thðé eujchðé scolavzein.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rmh'. 4Oti ouj deið gunaiðkaû ejn twðé qusiasthrivwé eijsevrcesqai.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rmq'. 4Oti ouj deið metaú duvo eJbdomavdaû thðû tessarakosthðû
devcesqai eijû toú fwvtisma.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rn'. 4Oti deið touúû fwtizomevnouû, thún pivstin ejkmanqavnein,
kaiú thðé pevmpthé thðû eJbdomavdoû ajpaggevllein twðé ejpiskovpwé
 <COL N="0073D"></COL> hÞ toiðû presbutevroiû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rna'. 4Oti deið touúû ejn novswé paralambavnontaû toú fwvtisma,
kaiú eiøta ajnastavntaû, ejkmanqavnein thún pivstin, kaiú
ginwvskein oåti qeivaû dwreaðû kathxiwvqhsan.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rnb'. 4Oti deið touúû fwtizomevnouû metaú toú bavptisma
crivesqai crivsmati ejpouranivwé kaiú metovcouû eiønai thðû
basileivaû touð Cristouð [touð Qeouð].</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rng' 4Oti ouj deið thðé tessarakosthðé aærton prosfevrein,
eij mhú ejn sabbavtwðé kaiú kuriakhðé movnon.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rnd'. 4Oti ouj deið ejn tessarakosthðé thðé uJstevraé eJbdomavdi
thún pevmpthn luvein, kaiú oålhn thún tessarakosthún ajtimavzein×
ajllaú deið paðsan thún tessarakosthún [aujthún] nhsteuvein
xhrofagouðntaû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0073"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rne'. 4Oti ouj deið ejn tessarakosthðé martuvrwn genevqlia
 <COL N="0075A"></COL> ejpiteleiðn, ajllaú twðn aJgivwn martuvrwn mneivan [mnhvmaû]
poieiðn ejn toiðû sabbavtoiû kaiú ejn taiðû kuriakaiðû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0075"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rn¾'. 4Oti ouj deið ejn tessarakosthðé gavmouû hÞ genevqlia
ejpiteleiðn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0075"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rnz'. 4Oti ouj deið cristianouúû eijû gavmouû ajpercomevnouû,
ballivzein hÞ ojrceiðsqai, ajllaú semnwðû deipneiðn hÞ
ajristaðén, wJû prevpei cristianoiðû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0075"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rnh'. 4Oti ouj deið iJeratikouúû hÞ klhrikouvû tinaû qewrivaû
qewreiðn ejn gavmoiû, hÞ deivpnoiû, ajllaú proú touð eijsevrcesqai
touúû qumelikouúû, ejgeivresqai aujtouúû kaiú ajnacwreiðn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0075"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rnq'. 4Oti ouj deið iJeratikouúû hÞ klhrikouúû ejk sumbolhðû
sumpovsia ejpiteleiðn, ajll1 oujdeú laiçkouvû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0075"><COL N="0075B"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rx'. 4Oti ouj deið presbutevrouû proú thðû eijsovdou touð
ejpiskovpou eijsievnai kaiú kaqevzesqai ejn twðé bhvmati× ajllaú
metaú touð ejpiskovpou eijsievnai, plhún eij mhú ajnwmaloivh hÞ
ajpodhmoið oJ ejpivskopoû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0075"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rxa'. 4Oti ouj deið ejn taiðû kwvmaiû kaiú ejn taiðû cwvraiû
kaqivstasqai ejpiskovpouû, ajllaú periodeutaúû, touúû mevn toi
hædh prokatastaqevntaû, mhdeún pravttein aæneu gnwvmhû
touð ejpiskovpou touð ejn thðé povlei× wJsauvtwû deú kaiú touúû
presbutevrouû mhdeún pravttein aæneu thðû gnwvmhû touð ejpiskovpou.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0075"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rxb'. 4Oti ouj deið ejn toiðû oiækoiû prosforaúû givnesqai
paraú ejpiskovpwn hÞ presbutevrwn.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0075"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>rxg'. 4Oti ouj deið ijdiwtikouúû yalmouúû levgesqai ejn thðé
ejkklhsivaé oujdeú ajkanovnista bibliva, ajllaú movna taú kanonikaú
thðû palaiaðû kaiú kainhðû diaqhvkhû.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0075"><COL N="0075C"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>4Osa deið bibliva ajnaginwvskesqai thðû palaiaðû diaqhvkhû×
a'. Gevnesiû kovsmou. b'. 3Exodoû ejx Aijguvptou g'. Leuitikovn.
d'. 1Ariqmoiv. e'. Deuteronovmion. ¾'. 1Ihsouð Nauhv.
z'. Kritaiv, 2Rouvq. h'. 1Esqhvr. q'. Basileiwðn a' kaiú b'.
i'. Basileiwðn g' kaiú d'. ia'. Paraleipovmena a' kaiú b',
