aijtivaû tauvthû sugkaloumevnwn, kaiú mhú prwðton [provteron]
ejnivstasqai thún kathgorivan, priún hÞ ejggravfwû aujtouúû toún
iæson aujtoiðû uJpotimhvsasqai [ejpitimhvsasqai] kivndunon,
eiæper ejn thðé twðn pragmavtwn tavxei [ejxetavxei] sukofantouðnteû
toún kathgorouvmenon ejpivskopon ejlegcqeiðen. Eij dev
tiû katafronhvsaû twðn kataú taú prodhlwqevnta dedogmevnwn,
tolmhvseien hÞ basilikaúû [basilikaiðû] ejnocleiðn ajkoaúû
 <COL N="0079C"></COL> [ajkoaiðû], hÞ kosmikwðn ajrcovntwn dikasthvria, hÞ oijkoumenikhún
suvnodon taravssein, pavntaû ajtimavsaû touúû thðû
dioikhvsewû ejpiskovpouû, toún toiouðton toú paravpan eijû
kathgorivan mhú eiønai dektoún, wJû kaqubrivsanta touúû kanovnaû, kaiú thún ejkklhsiastikhún lumhnavmenon eujtaxivan.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0079"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ro'. Touúû prostiqemevnouû thðé ojrqodoxivaé kaiú thðé merivdi
twðn swzomevnwn ajpoú aiJretikwðn, decovmeqa kataú thún uJpotetagmevnhn
ajkolouqivan kaiú sunhvqeian× 1Areianouúû meún kaiú
Makedonianouúû kaiú Sabbatianouúû kaiú Nauatianouúû, touúû levgontaû
eJautouúû kaqarouúû kaiú ajristerouúû [ajrivstouû], kaiú
touúû Tessareskaidekativtaû eiætoun [hægoun] Tetradivtaû,
kaiú 1Apollinaristaúû decovmeqa didovntaû libevllouû kaiú
