 <COL N="0083A"></COL> eij fwraqeiðevn tineû eiæte ejpivskopoi eiæte klhrikoiú, eiæte laiçkoiú
hÞ fronouðnteû hÞ didavskonteû taú ejn thðé prokomisqeivshé
ejkqevsei paraú Carisivou touð presbutevrou, periú thðû ejnanqrwphvsewû
touð monogenouðû uiJouð touð Qeouð, hægoun taú pikraú
[miarav] kaiú diestrammevna touð Nestorivou dovgmata, aÝ
kaiú uJpotevtaktai, uJpokeivsqwsan thðé ajpofavsei thðû aJgivaû
tauvthéû kaiú oijkoumenikhðû sunovdou× wåste dhlonovti toún meún
ejpivskopon ajpallotriouðsqai thðû ejpiskophðû kaiú eiønai kaqhérhmevnon,
toún deú klhrikoún oJmoivwû ejkpivptein touð klhvrou.
Eij deú laiçkovû tiû eiæh, kaiú oußtoû ajnaqematizevsqw kaqwúû
eiærhtai.</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0083"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>roh'. Praðgma paraú touúû ejkklhsiastikouúû qesmouúû
kaiú touúû kanovnaû twðn aJgivwn patevrwn kainotomoumenon,
kaiú thðû pavntwn ejleuqerivaû aJptovmenon, proshvggeilen oJ
