thðû ghðû krupthvrwn ajnakaluvptesqai, tovte kaviú fanerouðtai,
kaiú kruptomevnh ajnakaluvptetai× kaq1 oÝn aæra kaiú
 <COL N="0436B"></COL> crovnon kaiú trovpon oJ tauvthn fanerwvsaû eujdovkhse× kaiú
